---
name: text
type: registry:ui
title: Text
description: A polymorphic body text component with size, weight, tone, and alignment variants.
dependencies:
  - tailwind-variants
files:
  - path: registry/items/components/text/text.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/text/text.svelte"
  - path: registry/items/components/text/text.types.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/text/text.types.ts"
  - path: registry/items/components/text/text.variants.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/text/text.variants.ts"
---

Use text for paragraphs, captions, and inline copy. It renders a `p` by default; `as` switches the
element without changing the typographic styling. Set `size`, `weight`, `tone`, and `align` to style it.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import Text from '~/components/text/text.svelte';
</script>

<Text size="lg">The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.</Text>
<Text as="span" size="sm" tone="muted">Last updated 2 hours ago</Text>
```
